                <mxCell id="s1-d" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;메트릭 수집&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;ECS 서비스가 CPU·메모리·태스크수를 CloudWatch 로 발행. AWS/ECS + ECS/ContainerInsights(클러스터 Container Insights 켜짐).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="s1-g" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="52" width="510" height="64" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
